    "input_texts": [
      "Title: Sort ServiceNow Asset List by Function\nDescription: Steps to sort the Asset List module by 'Asset function' and mark the task as complete.\n- Navigate to the 'All Assets' view by clicking 'All', typing 'All Assets' in the filter box, and selecting the link.\n- Click the 'Show / hide filter' button to reveal the filter controls on the Asset List page.\n- Click the 'Add Sort' button to open the sorting configuration.\n- Select the 'Order results by the following fields' combobox.\n- Choose 'Asset function' from the dropdown list.\n- Press Enter to confirm the selection or click the option to finalize it.\n- Click the 'Run filter' button to apply the sorting criteria.\n- Navigate back to the task list and update the task state to 'Closed Complete'."
